  "query": "-- `completed` is INTEGER in SQLite, which sqlx would infer as i64; the annotation maps it to\n-- the Rust bool field. It must stay on the column for query_file_as(Task, ..) to compile.\nSELECT\n    t.id,\n    t.title,\n    t.details,\n    t.project_id,\n    p.name AS project,\n    t.planned_for,\n    t.due_on,\n    t.repeat_weekday,\n    t.created_at,\n    t.updated_at,\n    t.completed AS \"completed: bool\",\n    t.status_id,\n    t.reminders AS \"reminders: sqlx::types::Json<Vec<super::model::CustomReminder>>\"\nFROM tasks t\nJOIN projects p ON p.id = t.project_id\nWHERE t.id = ?\n",
